    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55146" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατασκευ-αστικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fitted for providing</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>VV</u>
				1250b29
			</span></i>; <i>fitted for bringing about</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ μὴ πλανᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.347
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in Logic,
				<i>constructive, positive</i>, opp. destructive (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λυτικός, ἀνασκευαστικός</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1403a25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theon
				<u>Prog.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, etc.: c.gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος κ. ζητήματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Corn.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					p.377
				</span></i>
			 H., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nicol.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				p.29
			</span></i> F. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνασκευαστικῶς</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>APr.</u>
				52a31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατασκευή</span> VIII) <i>systematic</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμνάσια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.177
				</span></i>
			.</div>
